# Row A producer round — what closed, what did not

This round stopped treating A1a as the whole frontier and worked the Row A
producer family in parallel: the source lane (S1/S2/S4), the remainder lane, the
two-sidedness of the shell Gaussian sector, and the trajectory that the shell
bound is supposed to produce.

Everything below is Lean, builds with `lake build RequestProject` (8112 jobs,
green), contains no `sorry`, no `axiom` and no unsafe pragma anywhere under
`RequestProject/`, and `#print axioms` on every new top-level theorem reports
only `propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound`.

**Row A is not closed. Rows A, B, C, D stay open and the frozen research count
stays 4.** Nothing below is promoted on the strength of a receipt, a Boolean
placeholder, an authority citation, or a renamed ledger.

